 		}
 	})
+
+	// Row 14 — NO SocksTimeout directive (T208). The data plane's upstream
+	// deadline (contracts/socks5-auth.md §"Deadlines") is sized against Tor's
+	// default SocksTimeout of 120 s; setting the option requires re-deriving
